{"id":"47a55612b580d7cb","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-df-zfc-order12-lexicographic-sum-order.md","title":"ZFC Order12 Lexicographic Sum Order","display":"df-zfc-order12-lexicographic-sum-order — ZFC Order12 Lexicographic Sum Order","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-order12-lexicographic-sum-order","aliases":["58-df-zfc-order12-lexicographic-sum-order"],"display":"df-zfc-order12-lexicographic-sum-order — ZFC Order12 Lexicographic Sum Order","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-order.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-order12-lexicographic-sum-order"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-order12-lexicographic-sum-order</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-order12-lexicographic-sum-order — ZFC Order12 Lexicographic Sum Order"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2aa29158e60b337f\" href=\"?note=2aa29158e60b337f\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-order.md\">../batch12/58-df-order.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I,\\leq_I,\\vec P,\\vec{\\leq},S,R\\in V\">\\(I,\\leq_I,\\vec P,\\vec{\\leq},S,R\\in V\\)</span>, with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_I\\subseteq I\\times I\">\\(\\leq_I\\subseteq I\\times I\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq S\\times S\">\\(R\\subseteq S\\times S\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder12LexicographicSumOrder}_S\\subseteq V^6\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrder12LexicographicSumOrder}_S\\subseteq V^6\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PartialOrder}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\operatorname{PartialOrder}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (relation-first predicate; see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2aa29158e60b337f\" href=\"?note=2aa29158e60b337f\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-order.md\">../batch12/58-df-order.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order12\\text{-}lexicographic\\text{-}sum\\text{-}order}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder12LexicographicSumOrder}_S(R,S,I,\\leq_I,\\vec P,\\vec{\\leq})\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{PartialOrder}_S(\\leq_I,I)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec P,I,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec P))\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec{\\leq},I,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec{\\leq}))\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\n\\operatorname{PartialOrder}_S(\\vec{\\leq}(i),\\vec P(i))\n\\land S=\\{\\langle i,x\\rangle\\mid i\\in I\\land x\\in\\vec P(i)\\}\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land R=\\bigl\\{\n\\langle\\langle i,x\\rangle,\\langle j,y\\rangle\\rangle\\in S\\times S\\mid\n\\bigl(i\\neq j\\land\\langle i,j\\rangle\\in\\leq_I\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{45mm}{}\\lor\n\\bigl(i=j\\land\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in\\vec{\\leq}(i)\\bigr)\n\\bigr\\}\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\operatorname{PartialOrder}_S(R,S).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order12\\text{-}lexicographic\\text{-}sum\\text{-}order}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder12LexicographicSumOrder}_S(R,S,I,\\leq_I,\\vec P,\\vec{\\leq})\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{PartialOrder}_S(\\leq_I,I)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec P,I,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec P))\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec{\\leq},I,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec{\\leq}))\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\n\\operatorname{PartialOrder}_S(\\vec{\\leq}(i),\\vec P(i))\n\\land S=\\{\\langle i,x\\rangle\\mid i\\in I\\land x\\in\\vec P(i)\\}\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land R=\\bigl\\{\n\\langle\\langle i,x\\rangle,\\langle j,y\\rangle\\rangle\\in S\\times S\\mid\n\\bigl(i\\neq j\\land\\langle i,j\\rangle\\in\\leq_I\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{45mm}{}\\lor\n\\bigl(i=j\\land\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in\\vec{\\leq}(i)\\bigr)\n\\bigr\\}\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\operatorname{PartialOrder}_S(R,S).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary lexicographic sum order definition.</li>\n<li>The cross-fibre clause uses the strict part of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_I\">\\(\\leq_I\\)</span>; using its reflexive diagonal would incorrectly relate every pair of elements in the same component.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-order.md","status":"resolved","id":"2aa29158e60b337f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-order.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3$ (see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-order.md","status":"resolved","id":"2aa29158e60b337f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{PartialOrder}_S\\subseteq V^2$ (relation-first predicate; see [[../batch12/58-df-order.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"I,\\leq_I,\\vec P,\\vec{\\leq},S,R\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq_I\\subseteq I\\times I","display":false},{"tex":"R\\subseteq S\\times S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder12LexicographicSumOrder}_S\\subseteq V^6","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PartialOrder}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order12\\text{-}lexicographic\\text{-}sum\\text{-}order}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder12LexicographicSumOrder}_S(R,S,I,\\leq_I,\\vec P,\\vec{\\leq})\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\operatorname{PartialOrder}_S(\\leq_I,I)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec P,I,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec P))\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec{\\leq},I,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec{\\leq}))\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\n\\operatorname{PartialOrder}_S(\\vec{\\leq}(i),\\vec P(i))\n\\land S=\\{\\langle i,x\\rangle\\mid i\\in I\\land x\\in\\vec P(i)\\}\\\\\n&{}\\land R=\\bigl\\{\n\\langle\\langle i,x\\rangle,\\langle j,y\\rangle\\rangle\\in S\\times S\\mid\n\\bigl(i\\neq j\\land\\langle i,j\\rangle\\in\\leq_I\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\hspace{45mm}{}\\lor\n\\bigl(i=j\\land\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in\\vec{\\leq}(i)\\bigr)\n\\bigr\\}\\\\\n&{}\\land\\operatorname{PartialOrder}_S(R,S).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\leq_I","display":false}],"bytes":1886,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2913","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-zfc-order12-lexicographic-sum-order.md|58-df-zfc-order12-lexicographic-sum-order]]（batch01）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","36d7463d215be751","2aa29158e60b337f"]}